        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "So after investigation, this happens because I couldn't find a way to fully emulate Vimscript's `:source` through Lua. And I don't think it even exists at the moment. The current `vim.cmd('source ... ')` emulates `:source` fine in case of no errors, but differs if some command throws error.\r\n\r\nI've opened neovim/neovim#18497 to see what can be done. Otherwise, I don't think I can do much within plugin itself.",
