        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I see, thanks for the explanation. As I understand in such case of an error at startup the session script is interrupted but mimi.sessions still thinks it has read the session file and keeps managing it. Maybe it can at least disable itself (with a notification) if it can be aware of an error? ",
