        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I stand hugely corrected. Although upstream Neovim does have inconsistency for error handling, there was a simple one-word solution to the problem: use `silent! source` instead of `source` to read session.\r\n\r\nAs far as I can tell, this should be solved on latest `main`.",
